r story about the so-called breast cancer genes, exploring the morass of legal quandaries, scientific developments, medical breakthroughs, and ethical concerns that surround the BRCA mutations. She tells of the troubling history of prophylactic surgery and the storied origins of the boob job and relates the landmark lawsuit against Myriad Genetics, which held patents on the BRCA genes every human carries in their body until the Supreme Court overturned them in 2013. Although a genetic test for cancer risk may sound like the height of scientific development, the treatment remains crude and barbaric. Through her own experience, she shows what it's like to live in a brave new world where gazing into a crystal ball of genetics has many unintended consequences. -- Provided by publisher.","subjectCategories":[{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"BRCA genes","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-pandora-s-dna-tracing-the-breast-cancer-genes-through-history-science-and-one-family-tree-lizzie"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Cancer","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-pandora-s-dna-tracing-the-breast-cancer-genes-through-history-science-and-one-family-tree-lizzie"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"SCIENCE / History","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-pandora-s-dna-tracing-the-breast-cancer-genes-through-history-science-and-one-family-tree-lizzie"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"HEALTH & FITNESS / Diseases / Genetic","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-pandora-s-dna-tracing-the-breast-cancer-genes-through-history-science-and-one-family-tree-lizzie"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"BIOGRAPHY & AUTOBIOGRAPHY / Medical","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-pandora-s-dna-tracing-the-breast-cancer-genes-through-history-science-and-one-family-tree-lizzie"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_libra